OL,3,AWar may be coming. Are we
OL,4,Apsychologically ready?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWar may be coming. Are we
OL,7,Fpsychologically ready?
OL,9,FIf the UK suddenly found itself at war,
OL,10,Fwould you know what to do? Do you know
OL,11,Fwhat would be expected of you?
OL,13,FThe government wants us all to start
OL,14,Fpreparing for severe disruption to our
OL,15,Flives. It wants us to stockpile canned
OL,16,Ffood and drinking water, strengthen our
OL,17,Fcivic resilience, and plan for the
OL,18,Fpossibility of war.
OL,20,FWork has begun on the government's
OL,21,Fso-called "war book", which hasn't been
OL,22,Fupdated in decades.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
