OL,3,ACanada welcomes EU proposal to become
OL,4,A'associate member'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanadian Prime Minister Mark Carney has
OL,7,Fwelcomed the European Union's ambition
OL,8,Ffor Canada to become its first
OL,9,F"associate member", calling for closer
OL,10,Fcooperation on defence, critical
OL,11,Fminerals and energy security.
OL,13,FCarney told the European Parliament in
OL,14,FStrasbourg on Thursday that Canada and
OL,15,FEurope were "stronger together" in the
OL,16,Fface of "geopolitical rupture".
OL,18,FHis comments came a day after European
OL,19,FCommission President Ursula von der
OL,20,FLeyen proposed "opening the door" to
OL,21,FCanada's associate membership, a status
OL,22,Fthat does not currently exist.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
